    text: "```"
  - line: 110
    type: narration
    text: "They floated in the silent void, the Ghost Spire’s retrieval tether holding them in a bubble of temporary safety."
  - line: 111
    type: narration
    text: "Behind them, Zar’Vokh completed its decoupling."
  - line: 112
    type: narration
    text: "It didn’t vanish."
  - line: 113
    type: narration
    text: "It receded, becoming a faint, dark silhouette against the starfield, a tomb for a jailed god."
  - line: 115
    type: narration
    text: "Luminaire’s network map updated in their minds."
  - line: 116
    type: narration
    text: "The cancerous, sickly yellow node of Zar’Vokh winked out."
  - line: 117
    type: narration
    text: "The cascade risk percentage ticked downward: 52% -> 44%."
  - line: 119
    type: narration
    text: "“Spire-9 is offline."
  - line: 120
    type: narration
    text: "The Hybrid Observer is neutralized."
  - line: 121
    type: narration
    text: "The network’s… immune response has been crippled.”"
  - line: 123
    type: narration
    text: "“Success?” Oreck asked, the word heavy."
  - line: 125
    type: narration
    text: "“A kind,” Geralt said, flexing his hand, feeling the strange deadness in the marble scars."
  - line: 126
    type: narration
    text: "He looked at Kyh, who was curled in on himself, staring at his light-cast shadow."
  - line: 127
    type: narration
    text: "He looked at Oreck, whose eyes held a new, weary depth."
  - line: 128
    type: narration
    text: "He felt the empty channel where ultimate authority had briefly flowed."
  - line: 130
    type: narration
    text: "They had traded a weapon for a wound."

